# Testing (agents)

Canonical guide: [docs/reference/testing.md](docs/reference/testing.md).

When you build or change a feature, or the user asks you to test, verify, or check it:

1. Read `docs/reference/testing.md`.
2. Add or extend automated coverage at the cheapest layer that can fail the claim (Rust nextest, Vitest, WDIO browser, WDIO tauri).
3. Run that layer before you claim done.
4. Do not invent a one-off harness. Leave tests in the repo.
5. Never enable Cargo feature `e2e` on release builds.
